WEBVTT

01:40.140 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.150 --> 01:45.979
[Episode 8]

01:57.289 --> 01:58.820
There's no demonic energy.

02:00.440 --> 02:03.440
Then why did they seek help from the Demon Hunting Bureau?

02:03.440 --> 02:05.370
You'll know once you open the door.

02:26.010 --> 02:28.490
Maybe he died in such a weird way

02:29.160 --> 02:31.700
that they didn't think a human did it.

02:52.290 --> 02:54.240
No, no, no.

03:00.210 --> 03:01.260
No, no, no.

03:01.350 --> 03:02.110
See?

03:02.150 --> 03:04.510
People don't scream when they're truly in fear.

03:04.510 --> 03:05.350
No...

03:05.370 --> 03:07.360
No, no, no.

03:07.410 --> 03:08.980
No, no, no.

03:09.030 --> 03:10.430
If you're really scared,

03:10.510 --> 03:11.930
wait for me outside.

03:12.830 --> 03:13.630
No.

03:13.950 --> 03:15.310
I'm a coroner.

03:16.070 --> 03:16.690
No.

03:16.700 --> 03:17.890
I'm a physician.

03:18.110 --> 03:19.810
I used to be a coroner.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.280
I can do an autopsy

03:23.020 --> 03:24.390
Are you sure?

03:24.990 --> 03:27.190
But I can only perform an autopsy on the floor.

03:27.190 --> 03:28.050
The ceiling...

03:29.180 --> 03:30.040
Is impossible.

03:31.420 --> 03:32.340
Goodbye.

03:32.370 --> 03:33.350
That's easy.

03:33.360 --> 03:34.020
Down you go!

03:57.230 --> 03:58.540
I'm done.

03:59.270 --> 04:00.500
The state of rigor mortis

04:00.500 --> 04:01.570
is easing.

04:04.600 --> 04:05.410
Really?

04:08.640 --> 04:10.440
Their hearts have been removed.

04:12.000 --> 04:14.020
Are you listening to me?

04:14.050 --> 04:16.149
Did your heart get removed too?

04:47.670 --> 04:48.680
Deer antlers?

04:50.940 --> 04:52.730
Have you heard of Cheng Huang?

04:55.130 --> 04:56.790
Wen Xiao mentioned it before.

04:57.490 --> 04:59.409
In the Western Classic of Overseas,

04:59.409 --> 05:00.330
the Cheng Huang

05:00.350 --> 05:02.580
is a demon who looks like a fox.

05:03.070 --> 05:03.710
There are

05:03.710 --> 05:04.850
deer antlers on its back.

05:04.850 --> 05:06.090
Its lifespan is very long.

05:06.090 --> 05:07.550
It's almost immortal.

05:07.710 --> 05:09.810
But legend says that Cheng Huang

05:10.350 --> 05:11.920
is an auspicious beast.

05:13.210 --> 05:14.340
Auspicious?

05:14.930 --> 05:17.100
More like a thousand-year jinx.

05:18.430 --> 05:19.810
Come to think of it,

05:20.200 --> 05:22.590
he's almost 100,000 years old.

05:24.020 --> 05:25.610
Isn't that just like you?

05:26.680 --> 05:28.550
I'm much younger than him.

05:29.940 --> 05:31.080
I mean

05:31.310 --> 05:33.150
you're a thousand-year jinx,

05:33.950 --> 05:35.190
just like him.

05:39.130 --> 05:40.070
So,

05:40.570 --> 05:43.230
this is a drawing of Cheng Huang's deer antlers?

05:44.350 --> 05:45.230
That's right.

05:45.390 --> 05:47.250
This is Cheng Huang's formation.

05:48.510 --> 05:49.350
Formation?

05:52.520 --> 05:54.030
Legend has it that

05:55.020 --> 05:57.340
Cheng Huang is an auspicious beast.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.950
It can help people achieve their wishes.

05:59.950 --> 06:01.150
Whether it's beauty,

06:01.670 --> 06:02.510
wealth,

06:03.270 --> 06:04.470
or lifespan,

06:04.990 --> 06:06.630
he can grant any wish.

06:07.510 --> 06:08.870
But they don't know that

06:09.710 --> 06:11.070
if the dream comes true,

06:11.190 --> 06:14.020
someone else must be sacrificed for the price.

06:16.390 --> 06:18.040
Sacrificing someone else

06:18.040 --> 06:19.500
to fulfill one's dream...

06:20.940 --> 06:22.070
How cruel.

06:22.690 --> 06:25.310
I guess I was right.

06:25.730 --> 06:31.030
[Map of Tiandu]

06:28.190 --> 06:29.310
These two places

06:29.790 --> 06:31.520
are where the murder happened.

06:33.920 --> 06:35.700
If I'm not mistaken,

06:37.040 --> 06:37.840
there might be

06:38.750 --> 06:41.090
a third murder here.

06:41.630 --> 06:43.190
And the time is...

06:43.550 --> 06:44.470
Tomorrow.

06:46.640 --> 06:47.940
How do you know?

06:49.580 --> 06:51.300
I hope I'm wrong.

06:54.950 --> 06:56.610
But if it's really the case...

06:57.380 --> 06:58.430
I...

06:58.550 --> 07:00.350
I have a brush on my head.

07:03.760 --> 07:04.650
Thank you.

07:04.910 --> 07:06.370
Tell me earlier next time.

07:12.750 --> 07:19.420
[Map of Tiandu]

07:24.370 --> 07:26.140
[Observatory]

07:30.060 --> 07:31.580
If that's really the case,

07:32.300 --> 07:33.490
this demon

07:33.780 --> 07:35.659
won't be easy to deal with.

07:41.510 --> 07:42.710
-Wen Xiao.
-Wen Xiao.

08:07.150 --> 08:08.290
Sister.

08:30.270 --> 08:30.740
Bro...

08:30.910 --> 08:32.110
Brother.

08:32.620 --> 08:33.409
Brother?

08:35.780 --> 08:37.419
Isn't your brother dead?

08:43.659 --> 08:44.480
Sister.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.230
Long time no see.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.720
Do you miss your brother?

09:00.520 --> 09:02.590
Heng is already dead.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.190
That's right.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.420
You killed me yourself.

09:16.700 --> 09:18.900
Because you said I was evil

09:20.130 --> 09:21.610
and unforgivable.

09:23.310 --> 09:24.740
Am I wrong?

09:26.980 --> 09:28.390
Even now,

09:30.060 --> 09:32.060
you're still killing the innocent.

09:33.720 --> 09:36.440
As expected, you always remember my bad.

09:40.190 --> 09:42.320
You never remember the good I've done.

09:53.510 --> 09:55.110
You're still the same.

09:56.230 --> 09:58.790
You always hurt your own brother

09:59.190 --> 10:01.080
for those unrelated people.

10:01.590 --> 10:03.220
What exactly do you want?

10:03.730 --> 10:05.400
I want to gorge your heart out

10:07.080 --> 10:08.660
for a closer look.

11:41.860 --> 11:46.920
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

11:46.960 --> 11:50.110
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

11:50.160 --> 11:53.090
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

11:52.130 --> 11:53.170
Mr. Zhuo.

11:53.180 --> 11:54.640
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

11:53.980 --> 11:56.020
You can already turn water into ice at will.

11:54.680 --> 11:59.660
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

11:56.050 --> 11:58.940
Shall we try materializing your sword form next?

11:59.010 --> 12:00.740
Giving form to the intangible.

12:01.070 --> 12:02.670
The concept is the same.

12:07.890 --> 12:12.750
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

12:12.850 --> 12:16.080
♫My definitions for right and wrong differ♫

12:16.130 --> 12:18.940
♫Bury your pride in the raging river♫

12:19.020 --> 12:22.810
♫Lamenting that all beings are powerless♫

12:23.470 --> 12:26.640
♫Born with talent, rumors ignite me♫

12:26.710 --> 12:29.850
♫They say I'm reaping what I've sown♫

12:29.920 --> 12:33.080
♫The tough people are worn by soft-hearted pain♫

12:33.180 --> 12:35.170
♫In heaven and earth, years slip away♫

12:35.270 --> 12:39.150
♫Sighing at a fate that cannot be changed♫

12:48.220 --> 12:49.390
Living beings in the world

12:49.390 --> 12:51.050
come in many shapes and forms.

12:51.380 --> 12:52.530
Some hatch from eggs

12:52.830 --> 12:54.360
and some are given birth to.

12:54.360 --> 12:55.370
Some bear colors

12:55.660 --> 12:56.990
and some have no colors.

12:57.070 --> 12:58.130
Some have thoughts

12:58.390 --> 12:59.950
and some do not have thoughts.

12:59.950 --> 13:01.050
If one is not with thought,

13:01.050 --> 13:02.850
then one is not without thought.

13:23.300 --> 13:25.550
Why are you always so nice to demons?

13:27.480 --> 13:29.740
Humans and demons have different paths.

13:29.910 --> 13:31.240
They should be enemies.

13:34.390 --> 13:35.850
Humans have human nature.

13:36.790 --> 13:38.650
Demons have demon nature too.

13:39.270 --> 13:40.380
Everything

13:40.590 --> 13:41.830
has its good and bad.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.860
People always say that

13:43.950 --> 13:46.210
humans and demons have different paths.

13:46.390 --> 13:48.440
But what's different is their appearance

13:48.440 --> 13:49.800
and not their nature.

13:51.490 --> 13:53.430
People always treat different

13:53.590 --> 13:54.630
as evil or bad.

13:55.750 --> 13:57.120
That's prejudice.

13:59.430 --> 14:00.470
Really?

14:04.060 --> 14:06.310
But I've never understood demons.

14:11.960 --> 14:13.600
Look at Little Mountain God.

14:14.630 --> 14:16.140
Though he's a demon,

14:16.790 --> 14:19.070
he has a kind heart.

14:19.980 --> 14:22.340
He even chants sutras for the dead.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.630
There is no difference

14:24.990 --> 14:26.520
between demons and humans.

14:26.810 --> 14:28.750
There are good and evil among each race.

14:28.750 --> 14:30.080
They coexist together.

15:12.160 --> 15:15.840
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

15:16.360 --> 15:19.350
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

15:20.520 --> 15:24.440
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

15:24.720 --> 15:27.630
♫The way back home♫

15:28.330 --> 15:29.950
♫With strong will♫

15:30.340 --> 15:33.850
♫I slowly carve out♫

15:34.430 --> 15:36.330
♫Growth♫

15:36.860 --> 15:38.230
♫Turning back♫

15:38.860 --> 15:42.220
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

15:43.090 --> 15:44.740
♫Waiting there♫

16:17.750 --> 16:18.310
Oh my.

16:18.600 --> 16:20.720
A gift from Mr. Zhuo?

16:21.630 --> 16:23.360
The sun has risen from the west.

16:23.870 --> 16:26.110
And it's such a beautiful jade pendant.

16:27.190 --> 16:28.650
I don't like to owe favors.

16:28.890 --> 16:29.560
Oh?

16:31.020 --> 16:32.880
Which favor are you referring to?

16:33.030 --> 16:35.580
When I told you about Cheng Huang's formation,

16:35.580 --> 16:38.320
or when I taught you how to freeze water into ice?

16:38.340 --> 16:39.580
Perhaps,

16:39.630 --> 16:42.830
for when I taught you how to materialize your sword forms?

16:43.520 --> 16:45.680
You mortals have a saying.

16:46.150 --> 16:47.350
The closer you are,

16:47.600 --> 16:48.870
the more you must settle the score.

16:48.870 --> 16:50.530
Don't push your luck.

16:53.480 --> 16:54.860
I will still kill you.

16:55.550 --> 16:56.590
I can't wait.

16:58.690 --> 17:00.880
Please keep your promise, Mr. Zhuo.

17:25.349 --> 17:26.390
Left, right.

17:26.410 --> 17:27.450
Left, right.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.359
Left, right.

17:28.430 --> 17:29.510
Left, right.

17:30.580 --> 17:31.500
Sister.

17:31.750 --> 17:32.710
Hush.

17:33.080 --> 17:34.570
Don't say that word.

17:35.700 --> 17:36.500
Which word?

17:37.220 --> 17:38.790
I only said one word.

17:38.900 --> 17:39.590
Oh.

17:39.610 --> 17:40.420
Sister.

17:49.930 --> 17:51.980
According to the report,

17:52.080 --> 17:53.540
three months ago...

17:53.560 --> 17:54.970
Three months ago,

17:56.170 --> 17:58.320
an identical case happened.

17:58.790 --> 18:00.410
The same method,

18:01.030 --> 18:02.970
and the same deer antler symbol.

18:03.350 --> 18:04.500
And the murderer

18:06.430 --> 18:08.330
was my brother, Pei Siheng.

18:08.420 --> 18:10.420
When you were on your demon-hunting mission,

18:10.420 --> 18:12.750
you shot and killed Pei Siheng on the spot.

18:13.750 --> 18:14.770
After that,

18:15.230 --> 18:17.630
you resigned as commander of Chongwu Camp.

18:17.650 --> 18:19.160
Why did you kill your brother?

18:19.160 --> 18:20.500
You could have just arrested him

18:20.500 --> 18:22.830
and sentenced him according to his crime.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.470
Because he became a demon.

18:26.800 --> 18:28.810
How could a human have become a demon?

18:28.810 --> 18:30.630
So what if he became a demon?

18:30.790 --> 18:32.590
Not all demons should be killed.

18:33.080 --> 18:34.480
How does that make sense?

18:49.870 --> 18:50.760
Sister.

18:59.540 --> 19:01.260
Are you here to kill me?

19:02.220 --> 19:03.650
You're evil.

19:04.750 --> 19:06.150
You are unforgivable.

19:07.180 --> 19:09.160
I'm indeed guilty.

19:09.310 --> 19:10.440
It's unforgivable.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.340
But Sister,

19:13.720 --> 19:15.270
can you forgive me?

19:16.710 --> 19:18.570
You must be able to understand me.

19:21.230 --> 19:23.070
Ms. Pei, if you can't do it,

19:23.230 --> 19:25.100
we'll kill him instead.

19:26.840 --> 19:27.630
Sister.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.300
Back then,

19:29.320 --> 19:30.380
I just wanted to...

20:04.740 --> 20:05.230
Bro...

20:05.670 --> 20:06.340
Brother.

20:06.880 --> 20:07.680
Sister.

20:10.150 --> 20:12.680
Back then, you turned and left just like that.

20:16.100 --> 20:17.620
You didn't hear

20:19.780 --> 20:21.510
my last words for you.

20:34.590 --> 20:35.390
Sister.

20:36.890 --> 20:38.360
Now that I'm dead,

20:39.540 --> 20:42.100
I can't do anything for you anymore.

20:48.880 --> 20:50.780
This case is so strange.

20:50.810 --> 20:52.600
Have you ever suspected it?

20:53.030 --> 20:54.150
Of course.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.020
We examined the body three times.

21:03.870 --> 21:05.530
He was confirmed to be a demon.

21:06.760 --> 21:08.220
No other result was found.

21:08.840 --> 21:10.750
What did you do with the body?

21:12.580 --> 21:13.710
I followed the rules

21:14.750 --> 21:15.550
and burned it.

21:21.160 --> 21:23.990
What about your brother we saw today?

21:24.850 --> 21:26.360
Did he come back alive?

21:28.540 --> 21:29.740
He came back to life?

21:31.880 --> 21:34.540
I don't believe there is such magic in the world.

21:35.580 --> 21:37.830
He wasn't suddenly resurrected today.

21:39.400 --> 21:41.750
The one who sent this case file

21:43.290 --> 21:45.090
was my brother.

21:56.360 --> 21:58.320
Why did he give you this file?

22:01.150 --> 22:02.950
He must have been wronged.

22:03.790 --> 22:06.140
He wants you to clear his name.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.290
No.

22:10.230 --> 22:12.370
His gaze wanted me to know that

22:13.940 --> 22:14.850
he hates me

22:16.590 --> 22:17.840
and wants to kill me.

22:18.850 --> 22:20.400
He wants me to suffer.

22:22.410 --> 22:23.400
That's wrong.

22:24.620 --> 22:25.750
I smell

22:26.360 --> 22:27.710
a conspiracy.

22:30.100 --> 22:32.600
He has a huge connection with Cheng Huang.

22:33.020 --> 22:34.280
If we find Cheng Huang,

22:34.760 --> 22:35.890
there will be clues.

22:36.800 --> 22:38.200
Why are you looking at me?

22:38.480 --> 22:40.540
How would I know where Cheng Huang is?

22:40.840 --> 22:42.570
When we were looking for Ran Yi,

22:42.910 --> 22:44.240
you said the same thing.

22:48.360 --> 22:51.060
It's so hard to fool you now, Mr. Zhuo.

22:56.830 --> 22:58.420
Cheng Huang's formation

22:56.940 --> 23:01.750
[Pear Garden] [Ming Palace]

22:58.440 --> 23:00.020
uses living people as a medium

23:00.020 --> 23:01.650
to absorb the power of life.

23:01.950 --> 23:04.510
And the place where the power ultimately gathers

23:04.510 --> 23:05.840
is the eye of formation.

23:08.620 --> 23:09.750
Cheng Huang is here.

23:10.270 --> 23:12.280
[Map of Tiandu]

23:12.670 --> 23:13.950
The observatory?

23:22.220 --> 23:24.080
When the Baize Token went missing

23:24.270 --> 23:26.070
and the goddess' seat was empty,

23:26.190 --> 23:28.720
the one who forcefully opened the Kunlun Gate

23:28.940 --> 23:32.100
and caused the demons to escape to the mortal world

23:34.790 --> 23:36.230
was Cheng Huang.

23:45.130 --> 23:47.770
Cheng Huang committed a grave crime back then

23:48.270 --> 23:50.930
and killed countless demons of the Wilderness.

23:54.080 --> 23:57.280
But somehow, he escaped the punishment of the Baize Token

23:57.350 --> 23:58.950
and fled to the mortal world.

24:00.150 --> 24:02.010
I don't know what he is

24:02.620 --> 24:04.810
plotting in secret.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.000
It's so high.

24:49.040 --> 24:50.840
This sundial looks familiar.

24:53.270 --> 24:55.400
Something's wrong with this sundial.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.240
It's not for measuring time.

24:57.900 --> 24:58.660
What?

24:59.630 --> 25:01.760
The sundial can be used to measure time,

25:01.760 --> 25:04.430
but it can only do so when there is sunlight.

25:04.540 --> 25:06.270
If it's used for measuring time at night,

25:06.270 --> 25:08.200
it'll need the help of a water bell.

25:08.770 --> 25:10.500
But there's only a sundial here

25:10.730 --> 25:12.260
and no water bell.

25:13.920 --> 25:15.310
Then this sundial is...

25:15.310 --> 25:16.350
It's an entrance.

25:16.810 --> 25:18.780
Cheng Huang is guarding the eye of the formation.

25:18.780 --> 25:19.810
This sundial

25:19.850 --> 25:22.380
is used to connect to the eye of the formation.

25:25.430 --> 25:26.760
We can't barge in.

25:32.900 --> 25:35.300
Cheng Huang has lived for too long.

25:35.380 --> 25:36.270
He has a weird temper

25:36.270 --> 25:37.640
and a lot of malicious energy.

25:37.640 --> 25:39.590
It's hard for us to defend ourselves

25:39.590 --> 25:40.950
in his territory.

25:40.970 --> 25:42.350
Stop showing off your knowledge.

25:42.350 --> 25:43.430
Tell us what to do.

25:45.220 --> 25:48.350
Don't you love helping others tie the knot, Ms. Wen Xiao?

25:49.070 --> 25:51.030
Please tie a knot for us.

25:51.060 --> 25:52.480
For the two of us?

25:54.590 --> 25:55.380
Ridiculous.

25:55.920 --> 25:56.910
I mean,

25:56.940 --> 25:58.910
use the Demon Binding Rope to divide us into two teams

25:58.910 --> 25:59.840
and tie us together

25:59.840 --> 26:01.830
to prevent us from being separated and lost.

26:01.830 --> 26:03.450
Especially those

26:03.750 --> 26:05.220
young friends.

26:05.430 --> 26:08.230
-He's talking about you.
-He's talking about you.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.550
I really want to tie it around your neck instead.

26:28.550 --> 26:29.760
I'm sorry.

26:29.790 --> 26:31.100
I'm not a dog demon.

26:31.560 --> 26:33.310
I like walking monkeys anyway.

26:38.840 --> 26:39.810
Yinglei.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.920
You stay here

26:40.960 --> 26:42.260
and don't let anyone come close.

26:42.260 --> 26:43.130
Huh?

27:00.800 --> 27:01.840
Wow.

27:06.780 --> 27:07.350
Eh?

27:07.370 --> 27:08.770
They left just like that?

27:09.860 --> 27:10.660
Bai Jiu.

27:10.780 --> 27:11.580
Then...

27:18.740 --> 27:19.690
Then I...

27:20.790 --> 27:22.450
How should I guard this place?

28:06.330 --> 28:07.760
Jiu.

28:09.930 --> 28:10.740
Sister Pei.

28:11.230 --> 28:12.270
Where is this place, Sister Pei?

28:12.270 --> 28:12.930
Sister Pei.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.580
Sister Pei?

28:17.300 --> 28:18.030
Sister Pei?

28:18.900 --> 28:20.160
Where is this?

28:21.320 --> 28:22.690
Sister Pei.

28:22.930 --> 28:24.390
What's wrong, Sister Pei?

28:24.560 --> 28:25.560
Sister Pei.

28:46.390 --> 28:47.500
Heng.

29:51.180 --> 29:53.840
Why did we suddenly come to Tianxiang Pavilion?

29:55.060 --> 29:57.070
Turns out the ever-so-serious Mr. Zhuo

29:57.070 --> 29:58.820
would come to such a place too.

29:58.850 --> 29:59.510
You...

30:03.410 --> 30:05.810
I came here when I was investigating a case.

30:06.830 --> 30:07.900
Just once.

30:08.470 --> 30:09.080
Oh.

30:09.160 --> 30:09.770
You...

30:11.900 --> 30:14.270
This is not the real Tianxiang Pavilion.

30:14.960 --> 30:17.690
It's an illusion Cheng Huang created with magic.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.610
I see.

30:20.950 --> 30:22.350
It's like Ran Yi's dream.

30:24.630 --> 30:26.560
It's way more dangerous than that.

30:29.670 --> 30:31.740
This is someone's memory.

30:33.040 --> 30:33.910
Whose?

30:40.210 --> 30:41.410
I guess it's hers.

31:06.330 --> 31:07.790
Let's split up.

31:19.330 --> 31:20.560
Whose idea was this?

31:21.460 --> 31:22.250
-His.
-Hers.

31:27.040 --> 31:28.810
Why are you complaining?

31:28.970 --> 31:30.460
You got two of us.

31:30.750 --> 31:33.650
Standing between two handsome men.

31:33.680 --> 31:35.410
Aren't you happy?

31:36.140 --> 31:38.560
You're the one standing between both of us.

31:38.930 --> 31:40.020
You shameless guy.

31:47.400 --> 31:48.430
You two have fun.

31:49.300 --> 31:49.750
Hey...

31:51.860 --> 31:53.870
One moment ago we were companions.

31:53.890 --> 31:56.020
The next, he's as cold as a stranger.

31:57.430 --> 31:59.030
You're much better than him.

31:59.960 --> 32:01.380
Time for a walk.

32:01.630 --> 32:02.160
Let's go.

32:10.760 --> 32:11.560
Sister.

32:14.930 --> 32:16.160
Why are you here?

32:16.770 --> 32:18.250
What are you doing here?

32:22.620 --> 32:24.150
You joined the Chongwu Camp

32:24.520 --> 32:26.070
without telling me?

32:28.590 --> 32:30.550
Why can't I join Chongwu Camp?

32:31.400 --> 32:33.760
The Pei family has been hunting demons for generations.

32:33.760 --> 32:35.420
I am the only son of our family.

32:35.910 --> 32:38.040
I should inherit the family business.

32:38.400 --> 32:40.310
But Father and Grandpa only value you.

32:40.310 --> 32:42.040
They don't care about me at all.

32:44.110 --> 32:46.190
They even gave you the family's treasured bow

32:46.190 --> 32:47.030
to you.

33:00.830 --> 33:01.640
Heng.

33:01.740 --> 33:02.790
Heng!

33:05.000 --> 33:06.060
Don't be so wilful.

33:06.990 --> 33:08.390
Look at your health.

33:08.970 --> 33:10.180
You are weak

33:10.500 --> 33:11.760
and feeble.

33:12.030 --> 33:13.220
How can you join the army?

33:13.220 --> 33:14.630
How can you catch demons?

33:14.860 --> 33:16.330
Do you want to die?

33:18.710 --> 33:19.350
Yes.

33:19.950 --> 33:21.230
You all look down on me.

33:22.870 --> 33:25.670
You think I can't achieve my goal because I'm sick.

33:27.060 --> 33:29.160
I want to prove to all of you that

33:29.440 --> 33:31.510
I can also join the army to hunt demons!

33:31.510 --> 33:32.670
Don't be willful.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.960
I promised Father

33:39.890 --> 33:41.520
to take good care of you.

33:43.160 --> 33:44.870
I did all this

33:46.000 --> 33:47.490
for you.

33:47.520 --> 33:48.030
Can you...

33:48.030 --> 33:48.730
For me?

33:53.700 --> 33:55.480
You did it for yourself.

34:01.200 --> 34:02.430
Since young,

34:04.950 --> 34:06.150
have you ever asked me

34:08.560 --> 34:10.110
what I want the most?

34:13.239 --> 34:14.040
Sister.

34:15.830 --> 34:17.830
Since I started to remember things,

34:19.520 --> 34:22.280
people around me kept saying that to me.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.510
"For you."

34:27.280 --> 34:28.120
"For you."

34:30.150 --> 34:30.989
"For you."

34:37.310 --> 34:38.500
This sentence

34:40.520 --> 34:41.620
is like a shackle

34:41.620 --> 34:44.230
I've been wearing since I was a kid.

35:02.580 --> 35:05.250
♫If you were a spring night♫

35:05.320 --> 35:07.990
♫I'm the silent mountain♫

35:07.620 --> 35:08.420
Sister.

35:08.340 --> 35:11.000
♫You're a sad firefly♫

35:09.710 --> 35:10.770
Isn't this shackle

35:11.070 --> 35:13.760
♫Guarding the last moment of the night♫

35:12.410 --> 35:13.860
on you too?

35:13.970 --> 35:16.710
♫Why don't you remember♫

35:16.770 --> 35:19.380
♫I'm always by your side♫

35:19.430 --> 35:21.330
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

35:21.350 --> 35:23.890
♫Guarding the memories♫

35:24.230 --> 35:28.010
♫And never wilting♫

35:31.040 --> 35:31.830
Sister.

35:32.610 --> 35:33.780
One day,

35:34.470 --> 35:36.310
I will surpass you.

35:38.410 --> 35:39.840
I'll be better

35:41.200 --> 35:42.480
and stronger than you.

35:44.740 --> 35:47.070
I want back everything that belongs to me.

35:47.700 --> 35:50.110
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

35:50.160 --> 35:52.960
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

35:53.050 --> 35:56.120
♫In the sky of floating snowflakes♫

35:56.200 --> 35:58.760
♫You are the only warm bloom♫

35:58.830 --> 36:01.570
♫But why don't I remember♫

36:01.640 --> 36:04.210
♫How much the plot has twisted?♫

36:04.470 --> 36:06.270
♫I forgot the bitter karma♫

36:05.960 --> 36:08.020
I should be the one holding the Shadow Hunting Bow.

36:06.310 --> 36:08.920
♫I missed it again and again♫

36:08.230 --> 36:09.940
I will also inherit the ancestral aspirations

36:09.040 --> 36:12.570
♫Helpless♫

36:09.950 --> 36:12.510
and be the one to bring glory to the family!

36:13.030 --> 36:15.510
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

36:13.790 --> 36:14.630
Heng.

36:15.580 --> 36:18.440
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

36:15.760 --> 36:16.470
Heng!

36:18.670 --> 36:21.420
♫I'm a black-and-white wound♫

36:21.470 --> 36:24.190
♫You're the vibrant red color♫

36:24.250 --> 36:27.060
♫How can I not remember♫

36:27.120 --> 36:29.810
♫You're always by my side♫

36:29.910 --> 36:31.920
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

36:31.960 --> 36:39.860
♫Guarding the memories and never wilting♫

36:37.590 --> 36:38.390
Sister Pei.

36:40.840 --> 36:41.670
Sister Pei.

36:41.950 --> 36:43.750
Why did you space out for so long?

36:56.230 --> 36:57.890
Why is there a doll over there?

36:59.670 --> 37:00.730
Let's check it out.

37:19.250 --> 37:20.330
Sister.

37:23.520 --> 37:25.060
Do you want to know

37:25.960 --> 37:27.840
why I became a demon?

37:28.210 --> 37:29.200
I don't know.

37:31.030 --> 37:33.250
You never told me.

37:34.900 --> 37:36.130
Sister Pei,

37:36.190 --> 37:37.670
are you talking to me?

37:42.080 --> 37:44.800
This doll looks scary.

37:45.980 --> 37:47.730
This doll said

37:48.810 --> 37:51.730
he knew why my brother became a demon.

37:51.950 --> 37:52.990
Was it talking?

37:53.580 --> 37:54.860
Why didn't I hear it?

38:21.110 --> 38:22.270
Sister Pei?

38:22.480 --> 38:23.710
Sister Pei!

38:23.950 --> 38:25.150
Sister Pei, where are you?

38:25.150 --> 38:25.930
Sister Pei.

38:27.570 --> 38:30.060
I thought the rope would keep us together!

38:33.110 --> 38:34.320
Mr. Zhuo!

38:34.670 --> 38:35.550
Brother Zhuo!

38:36.830 --> 38:37.710
Brother Zhuo, save me!

38:37.710 --> 38:38.700
Brother Zhuo!

39:10.470 --> 39:10.870
My.

39:11.550 --> 39:12.510
Mr. Zhuo.

39:12.740 --> 39:13.870
What a coincidence.

39:44.310 --> 39:45.980
The dancing girl

39:46.010 --> 39:46.940
is missing.

39:49.470 --> 39:50.470
She's over there.

40:05.040 --> 40:07.610
She aged so much so quickly.

40:11.430 --> 40:12.550
Did she?

40:15.440 --> 40:18.120
You men don't understand at all.

40:18.480 --> 40:19.630
Zhi Mei missed

40:19.660 --> 40:21.030
her blooming window.

40:21.250 --> 40:23.080
She was obsessed with the stage and dance

40:23.080 --> 40:24.870
and couldn't find a good time to get married.

40:24.870 --> 40:25.790
Great.

40:25.810 --> 40:27.760
No one is interested in her anymore.

40:27.760 --> 40:28.630
Now,

40:28.650 --> 40:30.830
the peony is blooming beautifully.

40:30.830 --> 40:33.080
Spring flowers don't know how cold snow is.

40:33.080 --> 40:35.510
The plum blossoms don't know the heat of summer.

40:35.510 --> 40:37.040
Each flower has its admirer

40:37.390 --> 40:38.590
and its own beauty.

40:39.470 --> 40:41.070
Why compare with each other?

40:43.910 --> 40:45.430
Zhi Mei, Zhi Mei.

40:47.420 --> 40:51.150
She must be obsessed with the plum blossoms's pride and aloofness.

40:51.530 --> 40:52.930
She enjoys her own beauty

40:54.240 --> 40:55.480
and isn't confined by

40:55.510 --> 40:57.720
the blooming window others speak of.

41:01.400 --> 41:03.160
Please show mercy

41:03.610 --> 41:05.490
and let me be beautiful forever,

41:05.910 --> 41:07.440
even prettier than before.

41:07.670 --> 41:09.800
Let me become the top courtesan again.

41:26.110 --> 41:27.860
Is he Cheng Huang?

41:36.130 --> 41:37.360
I get it now.

41:38.010 --> 41:39.620
Cheng Huang looks for

41:39.860 --> 41:41.920
people with obsessions in this world

41:42.040 --> 41:44.360
and grants their wishes.

41:44.390 --> 41:46.480
As long as they say yes...

41:47.010 --> 41:49.060
He'll make them a doll.

42:21.080 --> 42:22.240
See anything you like,

42:22.240 --> 42:22.920
Miss?

42:30.570 --> 42:31.590
These dolls...

42:31.590 --> 42:32.630
These dolls

42:33.080 --> 42:34.670
are not entirely dolls.

42:36.470 --> 42:38.070
Just like dolls,

42:38.310 --> 42:39.570
they are neither alive

42:39.940 --> 42:41.140
nor dead.

42:42.060 --> 42:43.140
When their bodies are broken,

42:43.140 --> 42:44.310
they can be fixed.

42:45.510 --> 42:47.410
But just like humans,

42:48.440 --> 42:49.570
they have memories.

42:50.020 --> 42:51.380
They can feel joy

42:51.550 --> 42:52.670
and sadness.

42:53.730 --> 42:55.040
So,

42:55.070 --> 42:56.780
they are dolls,

42:58.000 --> 42:59.600
but also not entirely dolls.

43:06.510 --> 43:08.240
I know who you are.

43:08.720 --> 43:09.350
Oh?

43:11.050 --> 43:12.470
You're Cheng Huang.

43:17.940 --> 43:20.610
Why did you turn Heng into a demon?

43:23.250 --> 43:24.420
It wasn't me.

43:25.790 --> 43:27.120
He did it himself.

43:28.160 --> 43:30.720
I just heard his wish

43:31.300 --> 43:33.130
and realized it for him.

43:34.110 --> 43:35.070
Wish?

43:35.550 --> 43:37.100
That's because

43:37.470 --> 43:39.190
you're too outstanding.

43:43.950 --> 43:45.480
You're superior,

43:47.160 --> 43:49.590
so you've never heard my wish.

43:50.520 --> 43:51.760
You have probably

43:51.940 --> 43:53.380
never heard of it.

43:57.190 --> 43:58.920
Wherever I go,

43:59.800 --> 44:01.240
I listen to

44:01.590 --> 44:03.570
the people's wishes.

44:05.780 --> 44:07.760
Then, I choose one

44:08.080 --> 44:10.060
with the strongest obsession

44:11.790 --> 44:13.330
to realize his wish.

44:15.390 --> 44:17.480
Your brother's obsession

44:17.550 --> 44:19.150
is far beyond everyone else.

44:21.320 --> 44:23.000
Do you want to know what it is?

44:27.920 --> 44:29.340
I know.

44:32.050 --> 44:33.600
He wants to be stronger.

44:36.200 --> 44:37.740
He wants to surpass me

44:39.040 --> 44:40.490
and replace me.

44:42.270 --> 44:43.710
He wants to take from me

44:45.110 --> 44:47.760
what originally belonged to him.

44:51.160 --> 44:52.260
How unfortunate.

44:53.630 --> 44:55.660
The mortal eyes

44:56.010 --> 44:58.480
can see mountains and rivers,

44:59.300 --> 45:01.900
but cannot see clearly the people around them.

45:02.460 --> 45:03.580
Although

45:04.110 --> 45:05.860
you're close siblings,

45:07.210 --> 45:09.240
you failed to see clearly

45:10.960 --> 45:13.290
what he really wanted.

46:03.710 --> 46:05.970
Do you dislike practicing martial arts?

46:07.190 --> 46:08.300
Yes.

46:19.140 --> 46:21.050
But I have to become stronger

46:21.830 --> 46:23.430
to protect you.

46:37.140 --> 46:37.870
Sister.

46:50.690 --> 46:51.640
Look.

46:59.100 --> 47:00.910
Although the dress is beautiful,

47:00.910 --> 47:02.570
it's inconvenient to move in.

47:05.970 --> 47:07.470
It doesn't suit me.

47:37.150 --> 47:38.270
What's wrong?

47:39.510 --> 47:40.860
Are you disappointed?

47:43.260 --> 47:45.420
I can grant your wish.
